    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "*\nProf. S.\nP. Ma Heng, the Divector General\nof the National Palace Museum, Peiping,\nrequests the pleasure of your company\nat a tea reception in honour of\nthe\nMembers\nof the American Economic Mission\nat Ex-Imperial Garden\non Monday afternoon, May the Thirteenth\nfrom three to six o'clock.\nVisit to exhibition\nrooms from three to five o'clock.\nTea and refreshments from five to six o'clock.\nEntrance through Shen Wu Men\nopposite Coal Hill.",
      "Мв. н. M. Bixby,\nPek1ng Hotel,\nPeiping."
